><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251110094809+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251110094813+10'00'" name="c0918cab-c23a-4af3-b274-b00c2378dff4" page="7" coords="321.845612,724.106445,326.979645,724.106445,321.845612,713.770508,326.979645,713.770508,332.220398,723.984985,561.406311,723.984985,332.220398,713.259521,561.406311,713.259521,332.220398,712.024475,480.248230,712.024475,332.220398,701.299011,480.248230,701.299011,321.845612,700.125305,326.979645,700.125305,321.845612,689.789368,326.979645,689.789368,332.220398,700.003784,561.444397,700.003784,332.220398,689.278320,561.444397,689.278320,332.220398,687.986267,561.435364,687.986267,332.220398,677.260803,561.435364,677.260803,332.220398,676.025757,443.731079,676.025757,332.220398,665.300293,443.731079,665.300293,321.845612,664.125305,326.979645,664.125305,321.845612,653.789368,326.979645,653.789368,332.220398,664.003845,561.464417,664.003845,332.220398,653.278381,561.464417,653.278381,332.229889,651.986389,561.425842,651.986389,332.229889,641.260925,561.425842,641.260925,332.229889,640.025879,561.435059,640.025879,332.229889,629.300415,561.435059,629.300415,332.229889,628.008362,519.835571,628.008362,332.229889,617.282898,519.835571,617.282898,321.845612,616.106445,326.979645,616.106445,321.845612,605.770508,326.979645,605.770508,332.220398,615.984985,561.435303,615.984985,332.220398,605.259521,561.435303,605.259521,332.220398,604.024475,561.406555,604.024475,332.220398,593.299011,561.406555,593.299011,332.220398,592.006958,561.454712,592.006958,332.220398,581.281494,561.454712,581.281494,332.220398,579.989441,561.416565,579.989441,332.220398,569.263977,561.416565,569.263977,332.220398,568.028992,428.502136,568.028992,332.220398,557.303528,428.502136,557.303528" rect="321.522614,556.968384,561.799561,724.429443" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: ● </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Female contact football players sustain contact breast&#xD;injuries during training and matches.&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>● </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Contact breast injuries (including the fear of sustaining&#xD;a contact breast injury) were perceived to negatively&#xD;affect football performance.&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>● </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Coaching and medical staff associated with female contact&#xD;football teams underestimated the occurrence of&#xD;contact breast injuries in their athletes, and therefore&#xD;increased awareness amongst staff is essential.&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>● </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>The study findings should inform future research into the&#xD;specific injury risk and mechanisms of contact breast&#xD;injuries, as well as the development of evidence-based&#xD;strategies to prevent and manage these injuries in female&#xD;contact football players.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="7" rect="609.448975,632.106445,793.448975,724.106445"
/></highlight
